{"2859190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gates of Despair", "steam_appid": 2859190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Warning: The game contains high-level horror elements and sudden scares. We definitely do not recommend that players with physical and psychological sensitivities play this game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/b8978835b831eca12b2e4625d3b78444.poster.avif?t=1779527057\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/b8978835b831eca12b2e4625d3b78444.webm?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/b8978835b831eca12b2e4625d3b78444.mp4?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gates of Despair</strong> is an immersive single-player survival horror game that plunges you into a dark and terrifying world. It consists of multiple intense chapters and offers a dynamic gameplay experience where each playthrough is unique thanks to procedurally generated events and environments. You must survive while facing a variety of challenges that test your wit and endurance, ensuring every run presents a new and thrilling experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Procedurally Generated Gameplay:</strong> No two playthroughs are the same. With procedurally generated levels and events, the gameplay remains fresh and unpredictable.<br><br><strong>Survival Elements:</strong> Try to survive and don't let the evil win. Find weapons and fight for your life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/927d9c4ea7355c8c7315fac79715a680.poster.avif?t=1779527057\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/927d9c4ea7355c8c7315fac79715a680.webm?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/927d9c4ea7355c8c7315fac79715a680.mp4?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Thrilling Story:</strong> Explore the captivating story of Gates of Despair, which runs through the entire game and comes to life in high-quality cutscenes. Immerse yourself and become a part of this captivating narrative.<br><br><strong>Terrifying Enemies:</strong> Face a variety of fearsome creatures and malicious forces that seek to end your life. Sometimes, running is your best option.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/50106b0458a9c3cf53b31ce869a8b0f7.poster.avif?t=1779527057\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/50106b0458a9c3cf53b31ce869a8b0f7.webm?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/50106b0458a9c3cf53b31ce869a8b0f7.mp4?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Atmospheric Environments:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world filled with dark, detailed settings and scary sounds that will send chills down your spine.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/61e54ae178a7c7aa92a0ff4dfc4e619d.avif?t=1779527057\" width=616 height=218 /></span><br><br><strong>Single-Player Experience:</strong> Enjoy an intense and immersive single-player adventure, where you have to confront the horrors of this world alone.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><br>Gates of Despair is a single-player survival horror game, which is divided into multiple chapters connected by a captivating storyline. In order to keep evil at bay, a number of challenges must be overcome. But be careful... Survival has the highest priority. Escape is not always an option, find weapons to defend yourself and survive!", "about_the_game": "<strong>Warning: The game contains high-level horror elements and sudden scares. We definitely do not recommend that players with physical and psychological sensitivities play this game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/b8978835b831eca12b2e4625d3b78444.poster.avif?t=1779527057\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/b8978835b831eca12b2e4625d3b78444.webm?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859190/extras/b8978835b831eca12b2e4625d3b78444.mp4?t=1779527057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Gates of Despair</strong> is an immersive single-player survival horror game that plunges you into a dark and terrifying world. It consists of multiple intense chapters and offers a dynamic gameplay experience where each playthrough is unique thanks to procedurally generated events and environments. You must survive while facing a variety of challenges that test your wit and endurance, ensuring every run presents a new and thrilling experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><strong>Procedurally Generated Gameplay:</strong> No two playthroughs are the same. With procedurally generated levels and events, the gameplay remains fresh and unpredictable.<br><br><strong>Survival Elements:</strong> Try to survive and don't let t